00:10:57.790 --> 00:11:03.610
There are non exculpatory statements made
as if they were exculpatory.

00:11:03.610 --> 00:11:08.920
There is speculation and there are completely
unrelated issues brought up like when asked

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:13.199
